# JobEdge secrets — copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# .env is gitignored; this .env.example is the only one committed.
#
# No source currently requires a key: Job Bank and Eluta are both public,
# free, no-signup sources. This file exists so the pattern is in place
# before it's needed — e.g. if a future source (a paid scraping proxy, a
# rate-limit-friendly API) requires a token, it goes here, never in
# config.yaml or in code.
#
# JOBEDGE_EXAMPLE_KEY=
